     aaccppii__ssoonnyy — ACPI notebook controller driver for Sony laptops

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following line in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee aaccppii__ssoonnyy

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           acpi_sony_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppii__ssoonnyy driver provides support for the notebook controller in Sony
     laptops.  Note that not all features will work on all laptop models.

